Architecture: SwiftUI `View` + `@MainActor @Observable AnomalyDashboardPageModel` driven by an
injected `AnomalyDashboardDataSource` seam (production binds the KMP core; previews/tests inject
doubles). No networking/business logic in the view. Adaptive macOS (regular) + iOS
(compact/regular) via horizontalSizeClass. All shared components (TSStatCard / TSGlassPanel /
TSBadge / TSIconBox / TSEmptyState / TSErrorDisplay / TSSelect / TSChartPalette / typography) and
design tokens (Color.TS / Font.TS / TSSpacing / TSRadius). No SI conversion: the anomaly numbers
are raw signal-space values (web `fmtNumber`, no unit preference), so `useUnits` is not needed.

